{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "090eab17d86feae74b1102577028b7a3b71326d3b4fe0eec4747669bf0c03ddc", "ja": "ずっと前向き！", "zh": "永远乐观积极！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f44e2e67fbd9b42e2621eea9f6c949644d423350a10f3eb85550c36345bed657", "ja": "打ち上げで、5人をデザートビュッフェに招\n待したプロデューサーは、歩に感謝の気持ち\nを伝える。歩が前向きでいてくれたから、み\nんなが挑戦できたのだと。そして明日から\nBIRTHの新たな伝説を生み出そうと誓う。", "zh": "制作人为了庆功，请五人去吃甜点自助餐，\n并在庆功宴上对步表达谢意，\n认为大家之所以能完成这次挑战，\n都要归功于步的乐观积极。随后制作人发誓，\n从明天起会再让『BIRTH』诞生新的传说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "201ab49f5bf22a2aa5ddfb9cf8e723a1d8978e13f9b3ecb03682738c77edba38", "ja": "（BIRTHの公演は大盛況のうちに幕を閉じた。その\n盛り上がりは、劇場の新たな伝説となるだろう！）", "zh": "（『BIRTH』的公演在一片盛况中落幕。\n如此盛况，应该会成为剧场的新传说吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "113c1c85635166b85cef13a6ed643e4eba184aee91f4df3881a7da2e349978ec", "ja": "（今日は打ち上げだ。みんなには、\nしっかり骨休めをしてもらわないとな）", "zh": "（今天是庆功宴，\n得让大家好好休息才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "ece8e1e9bbb06fa1f8319e0386f988bcdffb7c9a31d0bd9fb4c8b68f84f26652", "ja": "うわぁ……！　すごい、すごいよ！　キラキラした\nデザートばっかりで、まるでお姫様みたいだ……！", "zh": "哇啊……！好棒、好棒喔！\n全都是亮晶晶的甜点，感觉自己就像公主一样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "d750300fcbc6c82914928670024a1c51968e00606c8cf1a00661b34e1e03039d", "ja": "こんなにおしゃれなデザートビュッフェに\n来られるなんて……くぅ～！　頑張ってよかったです！", "zh": "没想到能吃到这么时尚的甜点自助餐……\n唔～！真庆幸在下有努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "39794d2f9ae5ac325b16de2f241b25141cb77d1374ba2be51b819c1887137996", "ja": "よかったね、真ちゃん。お茶の種類もたくさんあって、\nどれにしようか迷っちゃいます……♪", "zh": "太好了呢，小真。\n茶的种类也好多，真犹豫要选哪一种……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "365b40972602ae32d739df55e06439f3fef9a73d914838a8275cd11141ad4fd1", "ja": "デザートビュッフェにレッツゴー♪\n今日は無礼講、ゴーゴゴー♪", "zh": "甜点自助餐Let's Go♪\n今天不讲高低辈分，GO～GOGO～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "127cc04e761a594f12d3c7a9f3e7efe1a102692d8551ef67b548b4098379c6f9", "ja": "食べ放題だし、迷ってるヒマなんてないですよね♪\nみんなで手分けして、全種類制覇を目指しましょうっ！", "zh": "这里是吃到饱，可没有时间犹豫呢♪\n大家分头去拿甜点，目标是称霸所有种类！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ae52515b8a0809540988462706e05e0f7d2627606e94b477623c259aa70d071e", "ja": "可奈、いくらビュッフェだからって\n食べ切れる量しか取っちゃダメだって～！", "zh": "可奈，就算是自助餐，\n也不要拿超过吃得完的量啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "1755f2189b7388693a9269b056baf97b83350143778ab37ec42e06d01ca6106c", "ja": "食べきりますから大丈夫～♪\nカワイイケーキとランデヴー♪", "zh": "我会吃完所以没关系～♪\n来跟可爱的蛋糕约会吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8bc8376539fc8afc29d3afda4d40705bcccc53af234ef7d880ac38a15265c960", "ja": "好きなものを食べるのはいいけど、残さないようにな。\nというか、今さらだけどこんなに食べていいのか……？", "zh": "你们想吃什么就吃什么，但可别剩下来喔。\n是说，现在才问有点晚，但你们吃这么多没关系吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "d8ff86e6b1ffc315650c0ff5777a312dfd9cc82a2d6a963ee1388e0a2b63de85", "ja": "ひとつひとつは小さいケーキですから、その……\n今日のところは大丈夫、ということにしませんか？", "zh": "每一块蛋糕都很小块，所以……\n就当作今天没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "205c9df7b0dfdfd15c1ad52fa1c6fdef2558b02ad2a302a33ab8646464a6f73c", "ja": "まあ、今日は打ち上げですしね……。\n食べ過ぎるな、というほうが野暮かもしれません。", "zh": "好吧，反正今天是庆功宴……\n叫你们不要吃太多可能有点扫兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "3f1cf4b919e01bd4e25517bab0d96216d29a8eb77337cf1f9c35d1a93932060c", "ja": "すみません。……私、{$P$}さんには\n心配ばかりかけてしまっていますね。", "zh": "对不起……\n我老是让{$P$}先生担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "8f619815ed87f44dcfc3634606ec0f32a403a8f8e3f5abdabf015ad82e7756f2", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんがそうやって\nいろんなことを気にかけてくださるおかげで……。", "zh": "但多亏有{$P$}先生\n这样无微不至的关照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "7e795f9fb99d7af5e780eb0902a40d7936afd449176445f07e2838cb475b88b0", "ja": "今回も、とっても楽しく活動できました。\n本当に、いつもありがとうございます♪", "zh": "才能让我们这次也表演得非常开心。\n一直以来真的很谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "416c28c3b8035b240b503cad28bca1535c0fb0f61d861bbd64fef4cc128e1029", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ。今回はあずささんを含め、みんな\n俺の想像以上に頑張って、結果を出してくれました。", "zh": "哪里，我才要道谢。这次包含梓小姐在内，\n大家都比我想像的还要努力，才能获得这样的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "ecaf5798105e7b0df4b0716b63d49f391afb9c6ee1e867899b184ee41685986a", "ja": "うふふ。私も、まだまだ成長していかないと、\nみんなに置いて行かれてしまいそうですから。", "zh": "唔呵呵，因为我要是不继续成长，\n感觉会跟不上大家的脚步嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "cfb8801c34f6f175ad8adabf81b88c7a28bae1dcbf98cef4f728f8d8b0b3ce31", "ja": "そういう意味でも今回の活動は、とっても刺激になりま\nした。アイドルにも、いろんな形があるんですね♪", "zh": "这次的工作从这方面来说，对我是非常好的刺激。\n偶像也有各式各样的形式呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e4f97839e58651c9b9ffa375b46409006700ab56f89ec6303cf0dbc4b142f53", "ja": "あずささん、あずささん、大変ですー！\nケーキ、すっごいですよ～！？", "zh": "阿梓姊、阿梓姊，糟糕了──！\n蛋糕的种类多到吓死人耶～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "c00cc8a97cd634134eeebf820736b1b0568c0612b3acfb5dfaf54c96549bb4fd", "ja": "全種類制覇、早くもピンチ……どうしよう？\nでもでも、全部食べたい～♪", "zh": "称霸所有种类的目标立刻就遇到危机了……怎么办？\n可是可是，我全部都想吃～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "10e610a95e8b5797497dfe269bf05f5706330f5885b695e9d3c8f435744062fe", "ja": "あら、可奈ちゃんが呼んでくれてるみたいです。\nそれじゃあ、ちょっと失礼して……うふふ。", "zh": "哎呀，可奈好像在叫我。\n那么，我先失陪了……唔呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "d13a23caec1b1d101daac75b23cad52e46a4bbba29456e6ad4829f2221758965", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、私にも選ばせて～。", "zh": "可奈，也让我挑蛋糕吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "02fe40334793f94138b08a19aaeba199cff0841600c67e05f1fb4ac8ed860df5", "ja": "無理しないでくださいね～。\n……あれ？　歩、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "可别逞强硬吃喔～\n……咦？步，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "989a6e9beb547fbc0ce3fa99c437a58071264f0fccb30b9d7104a00ebfbcbec1", "ja": "{$P$}、ケーキ食べないの？\n選ばないと、可奈に勝手に選ばれちゃうよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，你不吃蛋糕吗？\n你再不去挑，可奈会擅自帮你决定喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "54fa6a10020046f269aaefc3936b4e359e744a4c809026376a1eb4df6f59c4a7", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n……歩、今回は大活躍だったな。お疲れさま。", "zh": "嗯，我知道了。\n……步，你这次非常活跃呢，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c5a7234a92fc008623c403aa2af85dc41fe2a1ad34118d9f6e00261fc48a7941", "ja": "ええっ！？　き、急になんだよ～。\n改まって言われると、なんか照れるんだけど……。", "zh": "咦咦！？怎、怎突然这么说啦～\n听你讲得这么正经，感觉真害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e41c2d7de19d9eefa41a75b19d84d1cc625c747bfd85254d4599c653743fbf80", "ja": "うん。でも、今言っておかないとと思ってな。", "zh": "嗯，不过我还是想趁现在先告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "be3a508a2ecbb2eea6095a5c6f743fb238edd25d5c07aa3ff92e6569eab944d8", "ja": "歩がずっと前向きでいてくれたから、可奈も雪歩も、\nあずささんも、挑戦できたんだと思うよ。", "zh": "多亏有你一直保持乐观积极，可奈、雪步，\n还有梓小姐才能完成这次的挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "eeeb9fed66b52b6fe06bba3ffd2df33563eab609881cafadb987f3fd962d112a", "ja": "えっ、そ、そうかな……？　そう？\nそうだといいな、えへへへへ……♪", "zh": "咦？是、是吗……？是这样吗？\n希望是这样，嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b9910f101ea1f3b58069d8fc8f68b308e574d13b1507641504728f366012627d", "ja": "あ、アタシはさ、ただBIRTHのみんなと、\n最高のステージにしたかっただけで……。", "zh": "啊，其实我呢，不过是想跟『BIRTH』的大家，\n一起呈现出最棒的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "51c846ec80743182043fbd7e769f60ea91927d05ca41b06121c18af9c8f665f0", "ja": "あとは、みんながダンス好きになってくれたら\nいいなって……ちょっとだけ思ってたけど！", "zh": "还有就是，希望大家能喜欢上跳舞……\n我只是稍微有这样的想法而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8688f336cf8eb107e08f0b0b2b054103dc1f1f54102d57041ebbd24bf21e21bc", "ja": "その試みは、成功したんじゃないかな？　少なくとも\nみんな、今は前向きな気持ちでいてくれてると思うよ。", "zh": "那你的想法不是挑战成功了吗？\n至少大家现在都有了乐观积极的态度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2a952ecb935655d1a49b1f5e812553880888df1b2eac92ee29009ce4e9a4e7b9", "ja": "へへ、そっか……うん。\nそうだといいな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吗……嗯，希望是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "91db46b6b2389df226200233ff91162f6f217ae1ceef46f490921f177b461f53", "ja": "歩、{$P$}！\nも～、何やってるんですか～！", "zh": "步、{$P$}！\n真是的～你们在做什么啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "53224cbfa2959bec3afabbce22af420f8b0cf00ce9c3c1e9047d48aac5dc1a36", "ja": "お茶が冷めちゃいますよ～。", "zh": "茶要冷掉了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "017df0ddb52124c26177ecc8b0acc553bc92f4273d4572595f65e431991a00a1", "ja": "あっ、ゴメンゴメン！　すぐ行くよー！\n……行こう、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉！我们马上过去──！\n……我们走吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "97a5bbe9cdaaa093e28cdf32890c9f5a5315f3427bfcf3dc381de471db18b256", "ja": "ライブは終わったけど、BIRTHはまだまだ続くし！\nまた明日から、アタシたちのコト、よろしく！", "zh": "演唱会虽然结束了，但『BIRTH』还会持续活动下去！\n明天起还要请你继续关照我们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "f056b008c375addf1d6b0d104cb30693e73691d1923ddb05b2938eb68a24afce", "ja": "ああ。こちらこそよろしくな！", "zh": "嗯，我也要请你们多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1038_p", "source_sha256": "fbd27f89b1280647587c4f4f466250d20107ef0c7418a8df638c11d9f2dfb832", "ja": "（食べきれないほどのケーキに囲まれた\nBIRTHの打ち上げは、こうして終わった）", "zh": "（在几乎吃不完的蛋糕环绕下，\n『BIRTH』的庆功宴就这样结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0030_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ce8e0be97774f66ce241a6507b0f1a376928acd4308618bb9c5e9e7bc6a7ee20", "ja": "（BIRTHは、これからも続く。明日からは\nまた新たな伝説を、文字通り生み出していこう！）", "zh": "（『BIRTH』今后也会继续活动。\n明天起也要如同团名般，再次诞生出新的传说！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
